  slides:
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 15daaeccfff210d458ffd6117930953b, type: 3}
    text: The final guardian has fallen
    duration: 2
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a785fdae291198348bfb5d53c63a3b68, type: 3}
    text: A mysterious light descended from the heavens.
    duration: 2
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8986910a1770fdb4894985c78964910e, type: 3}
    text: At last, the Goddess appeared before the warrior.
    duration: 2
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b9f2b8d832b72843aab1bf936ce11b0, type: 3}
    text: You have overcome every trial.
    duration: 2
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bc068cec45d933a4ebf4013da2d1ac76, type: 3}
    text: Your courage has earned you a single wish.
    duration: 2
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c3aba53c21ea2d540bb20afb4a55b07e, type: 3}
    text: And so, the Goddess granted the warrior's wish.
    duration: 2
